window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Zuri Price has no intention of responding to the strange invitation she'd received to some unknown place called the Red Key Club.</b></p> <p>She doesn't even like Valentine's Day, after all. But a charming neighbor and a cheating boyfriend change her mind, and, skeleton key in hand, Zuri steps into a new world and into a painful but unforgettable memory of her old one. It's one night of possibilities, one night of her dreams, but what will Zuri do when the star of her fantasies insists that one night could turn into so much more?</p>"; 
